From: JohnnyC96 <54557697+JohnnyC96@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:48:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 71/73] IOP: optional external SIO2 device (registers, DMA
 11/12, SIO2 interrupt), dmacman slice DMA on channels 11/12 and SecrAuthCard
 through it; runtime: PS2X_SIO2=pcsx2|off from the external library, memory
 cards in <settings folder>/memcards

